According to Apple's full release notes for version 13.0 of Logic Pro for Mac, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/05/apples-creator-studio-updates-start-rolling-out/">released today</a>, the new AI-powered Intelligent Assistant feature requires an Apple Creator Studio subscription for &#36;12.99 per month or &#36;129 per year. In other words, the feature is not available in the &#36;199.99 <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/logic-pro/id634148309">one-time purchase version</a> of Logic Pro.<br/>
<br/>
